OWNER-*.md
# DI-08: not in .git (Railway never sees it), but bot/DEPLOY.md documents a
# local `docker build .` that would otherwise send this — gigabytes of local
# git worktrees — to the Docker daemon as build context and let COPY . . bake
# other branches' working trees into the image.
.worktrees
